l table, seated in a cushioned pink chair beneath a dark underwater glass dome. Silver fish and green aquatic plants appear beyond the windows, with ivory serif lettering above and a gold botanical emblem at bottom-right. Text: Your ritual doesn't need to be uncomfortable. Hello Miz Jeannie watermark." height="1024" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/hellomizjeannie/6adbf208aaf4e.jpg" width="1024"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://hellomizjeannie.some.pics"&gt;@hellomizjeannie&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 23 Oct 2026 23:47:23 +0000</pubDate></item></channel></rss>